### REST API
### ========================================


### ========================================
### 1. ADMIN
### ========================================

### 1.1 Admin Login
POST http://localhost:9092/admin/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "",
    "password": "",
    "rememberMe": false
}


### 1.2 Admin Register
POST http://localhost:9092/admin/register-admin
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "firstname": "",
    "lastname": "",
    "email": "",
    "password": ""
}


### 1.3 Admin Forgot Password
POST http://localhost:9092/admin/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": ""
}


### 1.3.1 Admin Reset Password
POST http://localhost:9092/admin/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "resetPasswordToken": "",
    "password": ""
}


### 1.4 Admin Profile
GET http://localhost:9092/admin/users/me
Authorization: Bearer <ADMIN_TOKEN>


### ========================================
### 2. USER
### ========================================

### 2.1 User Login
POST http://localhost:9092/api/auth/local
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "identifier": "",
    "password": ""
}


### 2.2 User Register
POST http://localhost:9092/api/auth/local/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "",
    "email": "",
    "password": ""
}


### 2.3 User Forgot Password
POST http://localhost:9092/api/auth/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": ""
}


### 2.4 User Profile
GET http://localhost:9092/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer <USER_TOKEN>


### ========================================
### 3. CONTENT
### ========================================


### ========================================
### 3.1 STUDENT
### ========================================

### 3.1.1 Student Create
POST http://localhost:9092/api/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "data": {
        "name": "",
        "mobile": "",
        "cardId": ""
    }
}


### 3.1.2 Student List All
GET http://localhost:9092/api/students


### 3.1.3 Student List with ID
GET http://localhost:9092/api/students/1


### 3.1.4 Student Update
PUT http://localhost:9092/api/students/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "data": {
        "name": "",
        "mobile": ""
    }
}


